{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FREE BUILDING</h2>Any block in your anthill can be dug up and built upon at your discretion. Maintain a balance between convenient ant movement and keeping important buildings inaccessible to enemy raids!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/extras/underground_building.png?t=1727163668\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNLIMITED NUMBER OF UNITS</h2>We have no limit on ants. Build as large colony as you can sustain!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/extras/ants_increasing.png?t=1727163668\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MANY TOUGH OPPONENTS</h2>80+ different enemies from all corners of the planet<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/extras/enemies.png?t=1727163668\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MAKE YOUR OWN BUILD</h2>The game features many different types of ants with various abilities - queens, scouts, loaders, farmers, tanks, warriors... In combination, you can assemble almost any real-life species of ants.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/extras/cards.png?t=1727163668\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1238190?t=1727163668","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1727163668","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/a4be6faefc83563dbc4a82ccb0fb949bc9ce9b80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1727163668","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1238190/a4be6faefc83563dbc4a82ccb0fb949bc9ce9b80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1727163668","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28